Package: PhysioPreprocess
Title: Preprocessing Functions for PhysioExperiment Objects
Version: 0.3.1
Authors@R:
    person(given = "Yusuke",
           family = "Matsui",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "mail.to.matsui@gmail.com")
Description: Provides preprocessing functions for physiological signal data
    stored in 'SummarizedExperiment'-derived objects, including digital filters
    ('Butterworth' and notch), resampling, re-referencing, artifact detection,
    independent component analysis ('ICA') based artifact removal, and
    composable preprocessing pipelines.
Depends:
    R (>= 4.2),
    PhysioCore
Imports:
    methods,
    Rcpp,
    SummarizedExperiment,
    S4Vectors,
    signal,
    stats
Suggests:
    fastICA,
    knitr,
    rmarkdown,
    testthat (>= 3.2.0)
